#: scenario8:scenario8_3415F546_2206_41FD_913E_036A55A19598
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 590d12cb9033922be282dd8c4247f3b3fa3ad0a0b8d7878b632b44ef6cfca439
#. default-sha256: e3308f31425a393d5b17f94ee025425f92441d2a84bc30bb3e3c185b3eaf883a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3415F546_2206_41FD_913E_036A55A19598"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But all my questions, my confusion, my frustration—⟪k:1⟫everything that composes my "
"“present”—⟪k:2⟫is superseded by that darkness...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫...wisping away into nothing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma ogni mia domanda, la mia confusione, la mia frustrazione—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫tutto ciò che compone "
"il mio “presente”—⟪k:3⟫viene rimpiazzato da questa oscurità...⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"⟪k:7⟫...disperdendosi nel nulla."

#: scenario8:scenario8_95E8F20B_9A0E_4DF1_AA86_833544152729
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8451551d07a40f0ac2a7af2b1f89dec805560001f83d03a8d1abe24229db2860
#. default-sha256: 440e7040dddf22e2adec91f45f0c012dd190ee33e27629f06a09254fe8584d55
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_95E8F20B_9A0E_4DF1_AA86_833544152729"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I never “yearned” for the world outside what I knew. ⟪k:1⟫I more “coveted” it—a splash of "
"spite mixed in. ⟪k:2⟫I wanted to claw my way up the mountain, knock all the bastards down who had "
"never seen what it was like at the bottom.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫If I made it high enough, I could do "
"anything. ⟪k:6⟫I would have complete freedom.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫If that sounds like a childish "
"fantasy to you, well, you’d be right. That’s exactly what it was."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non ho mai solo “⟪k:1⟫sognato⟪k:2⟫” di vedere il mondo al di fuori di quello che conoscevo. "
"⟪k:3⟫Lo ⟪k:4⟫bramavo⟪k:5⟫—⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫con una certa dose di rivalsa.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Volevo scalare la "
"montagna fino in cima, buttando di sotto tutti i bastardi che non avevano mai visto come si "
"viveva giù in fondo.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Se fossi arrivato abbastanza in alto, avrei potuto fare "
"qualsiasi cosa. ⟪k:13⟫Sarei stato completamente libero.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Se ti sembra una "
"fantasia infantile, hai ragione. Era esattamente così."

#: scenario8:scenario8_3A6D383F_D886_440A_97F6_7CC9B5C6389A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9503eb260f8f91ca9f2dd1464431fa7e9952c3688af7a483be5a69ca5f041b83
#. default-sha256: 3548d7b916bc419c7a3d6d987a8ab83300a025ab223174aa13da90b6989a76bb
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3A6D383F_D886_440A_97F6_7CC9B5C6389A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“There you are. ⟪k:1⟫You spend so much time in the graveyard that,⟪k:2⟫one of these days, "
"someone’s going to think you’re a gravekeeper—⟪k:3⟫or maybe a graverobber.”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“I can "
"understand a grave⟪k:7⟫keeper⟪k:8⟫, but I take offense at the suggestion I look like a grave⟪k:9⟫"
"robber⟪k:10⟫. ⟪k:11⟫I’m praying for the souls who have no one to see them off.”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫"
"⟪k:15⟫The girl—named Morgana—turned around to face me. ⟪k:16⟫Though I’d known her for some time, "
"I’d rarely ever looked her in the eyes. ⟪k:17⟫Her face was almost always concealed beneath a dark "
"hood, revealing only the tip of her nose and sometimes her lips."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Ecco dov’eri. ⟪k:1⟫Trascorri così tanto tempo in questo cimitero che prima o poi qualcuno "
"ti scambierà per un custode—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫o magari per un profanatore di tombe.”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“Posso "
"capire un custode, ma mi offendo all’insinuazione che io possa sembrare un ⟪k:7⟫profanatore di "
"tombe⟪k:8⟫. ⟪k:9⟫Sto pregando per le anime che non hanno nessuno che venga a trovarle.”⟪k:10⟫"
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫La ragazza—⟪k:14⟫il cui nome era Morgana—⟪k:15⟫si girò verso di me.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"Anche se la conoscevo da diverso di tempo, raramente la guardavo⟪k:18⟫negli occhi. ⟪k:19⟫Il suo "
"volto era quasi sempre nascosto sotto il suo cappuccio scuro, rivelando solo la punta del naso e "
"a volte anche le labbra."

#: scenario8:scenario8_67C1772B_FF27_45C8_8ED4_4E60EADBB8D8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5202ec62f6b30c36fc6faa6a8b5c29e836fddb917f26bad99e97a604b477c74f
#. default-sha256: 5683521b0282688747e0afcd594bf008d0d563e2c29c76376ebf96cf096c0d05
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_67C1772B_FF27_45C8_8ED4_4E60EADBB8D8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Honestly, I don’t get it. Why do you care so much?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“These are souls that "
"have no one else to pray for them. ⟪k:4⟫At best,⟪k:5⟫they may get a bit of lip service from a "
"priest once or twice. ⟪k:6⟫It’s our responsibility to offer a helping hand to the sick and the "
"poor, ⟪k:7⟫to pray for the abandoned souls.”⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫“What I don’t get is why you need to "
"pray for the dead at all. ⟪k:11⟫They’re just bags of bones.”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫“I hope you enjoy "
"an eternity in Hell, blasphemer.”⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫“Hey! ⟪k:18⟫That was uncalled for!”⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫"
"⟪k:21⟫“I’m just joking, obviously.”⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫“You take black humor to a new level!”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Sul serio, non capisco. Perché t’importa così tanto?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“Ci sono anime che non "
"hanno nessun altro che preghi per loro.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Nel migliore dei casi, ricevono giusto una o due "
"preghiere da qualche prete. ⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫È⟪k:8⟫ nostra responsabilità dare una mano ai poveri e ai "
"malati,⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫e pregare per le anime abbandonate.”⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫“Quello che mi chiedo è "
"se ne vale veramente la pena. ⟪k:14⟫Insomma, sono soltanto un mucchio di ossa.”⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫"
"⟪k:17⟫“Spero tu possa goderti l’eternità all’Inferno, essere blasfemo.”⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫“Ehi! "
"⟪k:21⟫Questa potevi risparmiartela!”⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫“Sto scherzando, ovviamente.”⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫"
"⟪k:27⟫“Che razza di umorismo hai?!”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_2CC37D5E_F21F_4BAE_B73F_9B2D6284E332
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4ebaa51807890a9a9e1cac310a693a335a2c32b9f62a79f113f92b504f4f0d8d
#. default-sha256: cb3aed2032ed81af90d19ed56af307d5d4485bc786fff0f8165106dd19c90bce
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2CC37D5E_F21F_4BAE_B73F_9B2D6284E332"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Morgana gave me a curt shrug, then turned away. ⟪k:1⟫She never faced anyone head-on for very "
"long, and she had a perfectly good reason for it. ⟪k:2⟫It wasn’t because she disliked me or "
"anything. ⟪k:3⟫...I don’t think, anyway.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫About three years earlier, something "
"had happened that had caused large patches of flesh to fall off her face. ⟪k:8⟫Supposedly, she "
"had looked fine before then, but I only knew her as she was at that time. ⟪k:9⟫The rest of her "
"body was covered in wounds as well, but applying ointment to them had reduced the scarring "
"significantly.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Her face, though, showed no signs of recovering."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Morgana scrollò le spalle, e poi si voltò. ⟪k:1⟫Non guardava mai in faccia qualcuno per "
"troppo tempo, e aveva un buon motivo per farlo.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Non era perché non le piacessi o "
"altro... ⟪k:4⟫non credo, almeno.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Circa tre anni prima, era successo qualcosa "
"che le aveva fatto cadere grossi pezzi di pelle dal viso. ⟪k:9⟫Probabilmente, prima di allora "
"stava bene, ma aveva già quell’aspetto quando l’ho conosciuta.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Anche il resto "
"del suo corpo era ricoperto di ferite, ma applicando un unguento le cicatrici si erano ridotte "
"sensibilmente.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫La sua faccia, tuttavia, non mostrava alcun segno di recupero."
"⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫Una mia cara amica—una prostituta—riteneva che potesse essere la "
"conseguenza di un trauma psicologico, ma continuai comunque⟪k:20⟫ad applicare l’unguento sul viso "
"di Morgana."

#: scenario8:scenario8_AD23439B_53AA_4221_A353_48E40769E717
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4d78b6f9768a876f24e882c35d21bc2241b469b2196cbb8319c1572fba2fe0dd
#. default-sha256: b3826702ba7389e49564a0b4bc8ad723348fa5d10644717496a08ef5b4489438
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_AD23439B_53AA_4221_A353_48E40769E717"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫With a forlorn graveyard as their backdrop, a young man applied salve to a girl’s raw, "
"exposed flesh. ⟪k:1⟫It was quite possibly the least romantic sight in the world.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I "
"would have, at the very least, preferred a somewhat more pleasant location.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫As the "
"thought fluttered through my mind, I let out a defeated laugh, and I could soon feel her glaring "
"at me.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Morgana could be a bit standoffish, but honestly, I didn’t mind.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫"
"For her, this was actually quite sociable, in fact. ⟪k:13⟫When I first met her,⟪k:14⟫she didn’t "
"act her age at all, but now, she was starting to show signs of the twelve-year-old girl hidden "
"inside."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Un giovane che applicava del balsamo sulla carne esposta di una ragazza, con un cimitero "
"abbandonato come sfondo.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Era probabilmente lo spettacolo meno romantico del mondo.⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Avrei preferito quantomeno un posto più gradevole.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Mentre il pensiero "
"attraversava la mia mente, mi lasciai andare ad una risata rassegnata, e poco dopo mi accorsi che "
"lei mi stava fissando.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Morgana poteva anche essere un po’ distaccata, ma a me "
"questo⟪k:12⟫non importava, onestamente.⟪k:13⟫ Anzi, considerando com’era fatta, quella era "
"un’interazione piuttosto socievole da parte sua. ⟪k:14⟫Quando l’avevo conosciuta, non dimostrava "
"affatto gli anni che portava, ma dopo qualche tempo, aveva iniziato a mostrare tratti della "
"dodicenne che era."

#: scenario8:scenario8_F1A96C76_9177_4550_97E0_AE448E6B9E47
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 139b91975e75d29b5d8b230d315c5c8a63e4457b53ed09143811a09e12cf5148
#. default-sha256: 8e491a17cf60dd3a6e57ffbedd36fddae44b9f5deedd10c8f86b79d0e6bee547
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F1A96C76_9177_4550_97E0_AE448E6B9E47"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Three years prior, when I met Morgana, she had been the victim of unspeakable abuse at the "
"hands of the lord. ⟪k:1⟫I didn’t know why he had done those things to her, ⟪k:2⟫and I didn’t ask "
"either—because I knew doing so would only reopen old wounds. ⟪k:3⟫All I knew was that the lord "
"was so far gone as a human being as to brutally torture a nine-year-old girl.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫At "
"the time, the only thing that ever seemed to come out of her mouth was the word of God. ⟪k:7⟫"
"Everything she said or did was ostensibly for the benefit of others, ⟪k:8⟫but it felt to me more "
"like she was acting out of some sort of sense of duty rather than genuine concern. ⟪k:9⟫"
"Honorable, but ultimately hollow.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫I much, much preferred this Morgana, "
"⟪k:14⟫even if she could be a bit... jaded."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tre anni prima—⟪k:1⟫l’anno in cui avevo incontrato Morgana per la prima volta—⟪k:2⟫era stata "
"vittima di soprusi indicibili per mano del lord. ⟪k:3⟫Non sapevo perché le avesse fatto tutto "
"quello, ⟪k:4⟫e personalmente non le avevo mai chiesto nulla—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫perché sapevo che così "
"facendo avrei soltanto riaperto vecchie ferite. ⟪k:7⟫Tutto ciò di cui ero a conoscenza è che il "
"lord aveva superato ogni limite in quanto essere umano, al punto da torturare brutalmente una "
"bambina di nove anni.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫All’epoca, l’unica cosa che le usciva di bocca era la parola "
"di Dio. ⟪k:11⟫Ogni cosa che diceva o faceva era chiaramente a beneficio degli altri, ⟪k:12⟫ma ai "
"miei occhi sembrava come se il suo modo di fare dipendesse più da un qualche senso del dovere che "
"da un genuino interessamento. ⟪k:13⟫Onorevole, ma fondamentalmente vuoto.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"Preferivo molto di più la nuova Morgana, ⟪k:18⟫sebbene potesse essere... piuttosto fredda."

#: scenario8:scenario8_EEC57AB7_24CC_4487_88E7_654011AAFDFD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bc71c91ff0c289830bdbfd6dc8d8c289649a5d39711c26c20fb44f1ffa9fc188
#. default-sha256: 87c588be226d296724fc3147993c55913c8afa71cd4f0ee3c4ccca5ac81ab372
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_EEC57AB7_24CC_4487_88E7_654011AAFDFD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“What are you hoping to get out of repairing my face?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“I’m not trying to "
"‘get’ anything. I just want you to heal up.”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“And here I thought you were going to "
"try and make me work at the brothel.”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“How many times do I have to tell you? I’m "
"not going to make you be a prostitute.”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫“What other reason could you have for "
"wanting my face to get better?”⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫“Because I want to see it. ⟪k:16⟫Isn’t that "
"enough?”⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫“............”⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫“Just so we’re clear, uh, that wasn’t "
"me hitting on you, okay?”⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫“The thought never occurred to me.”⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫"
"⟪k:28⟫“............”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Cosa speri di ottenere rimettendo in sesto la mia faccia?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“Non sto provando "
"ad “ottenere” niente. Voglio solo che tu guarisca.”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“E io che pensavo che mi "
"avresti costretta a lavorare al bordello.”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“Quante volte devo ripetertelo? Non ho "
"intenzione di farti diventare una prostituta.”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫“Per quale altra ragione vorresti "
"che la mia faccia torni normale?”⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫“Perché voglio vederla. ⟪k:16⟫Non è "
"sufficiente come motivazione?”⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫“............”⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫“Solo per essere "
"chiari, ehm, non ci sto provando con te, intesi?”⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫“Non mi è minimamente passato "
"per la testa.”⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫“............”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_476B2853_E41B_4320_98A8_488FE11C40C1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1c0fe9a8afe67e50e79f8a597eacea6fba8fe54f82423c28ec1edb2ccd964dff
#. default-sha256: 8b264e0de810a5953f05bdac2b9d65db8bfdfe5510b07e7dc66783615ad3bd61
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_476B2853_E41B_4320_98A8_488FE11C40C1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She fell quiet, sitting there motionless as I rubbed ointment into her face. ⟪k:1⟫Her skin "
"beneath my thumb was rough and unpleasant to the touch—and, honestly, rather stomach-turning. "
"⟪k:2⟫It was hard to imagine her face would ⟪k:3⟫ever⟪k:4⟫ heal.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫What I’d said "
"about wanting to see her face was true, ⟪k:9⟫but what I wanted more than anything was for her to "
"be able to live a relatively normal life."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Cadde in silenzio, seduta lì, immobile, mentre le spalmavo l’unguento sul viso. ⟪k:1⟫La sua "
"pelle era ruvida e sgradevole al tocco—⟪k:2⟫e, onestamente, piuttosto stomachevole. ⟪k:3⟫Era "
"difficile pensare che sarebbe potuta guarire.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Quello che avevo detto riguardo "
"al voler vedere il suo volto era vero, ⟪k:8⟫ma ciò che volevo più di ogni altra cosa era che "
"potesse essere in grado di vivere una vita relativamente normale."

#: scenario8:scenario8_18791202_5BCB_4651_855B_39F3CAB6E65F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dc80c4a72b4b4a92e90a7c4e37aa37af852595bf6752dd5c24582cd950f2a140
#. default-sha256: 81050fdcbd0eb453f1796b8c9ba36bae21deee5332a699991e1862cac9754ef5
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_18791202_5BCB_4651_855B_39F3CAB6E65F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She had no parents. ⟪k:1⟫When I’d asked about her mother, she’d gotten cagey with me, so I "
"assumed she’d been sold off. ⟪k:2⟫When I’d asked about her father, though, she’d just pointed up "
"at the sky, which I took to mean he was dead.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫A young girl, no family, sent off all "
"on her own to some strange land, somewhere along the line ending up in the lord’s cruel grasp. "
"⟪k:6⟫“Misfortune” felt like an understatement, if anything.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫That said, it "
"wasn’t just out of pity that I gave Morgana so much of my attention. ⟪k:11⟫The other reason, "
"though... well, she’d probably go running if I told her. ⟪k:12⟫Hell, ⟪k:13⟫I⟪k:14⟫ wanted to hit "
"myself over the head."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Era rimasta senza genitori. ⟪k:1⟫Quando le avevo chiesto di sua madre⟪k:2⟫si era chiusa a "
"riccio, perciò immaginai che fosse stata venduta.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Quando le avevo chiesto di suo padre, "
"invece, semplicemente indicò il cielo, al che pensai che intendesse dire che era morto.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"⟪k:7⟫Una ragazzina, senza famiglia, mandata via tutta sola in qualche Paese sconosciuto, finendo "
"tra le grinfie di un lord sadico e spietato—⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫chiamarla “sventura” sembra quasi un "
"eufemismo.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Detto ciò, non era solo per compassione che davo a Morgana "
"tutte quelle attenzioni. ⟪k:14⟫L’altro motivo, beh... probabilmente sarebbe scappata se "
"gliel’avessi detto. ⟪k:15⟫Diamine, volevo seriamente sbattere la testa contro un muro."

#: scenario8:scenario8_2DAB02C2_9D17_4903_A9DD_F5DCD3E8E55C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f728c5730e9f87b2faf333a4560ebba05c587d93ffd03d6d7d957c210495c8b2
#. default-sha256: 0811819702478c2e0d899c8b194bd7a623ea2c61bc9aa2f7fc5343dcf6cdfca7
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2DAB02C2_9D17_4903_A9DD_F5DCD3E8E55C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She gave a sheepish nod, which was honestly kind of cute, but of course I couldn’t ⟪k:1⟫"
"say⟪k:2⟫ that, ⟪k:3⟫so I shrugged my shoulders, feigning exasperation, and then turned to leave."
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Once, I might have offered to accompany her back to the brothel, but Morgana "
"never seemed keen on the idea of walking anywhere with me. ⟪k:8⟫Maybe she was afraid of grown "
"men, after what had happened to her at the lord’s manor, ⟪k:9⟫or maybe she just didn’t want me to "
"be seen with someone who looked like her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Morgana annuì timidamente; un gesto che la fece apparire piuttosto carina, ma naturalmente "
"questo ⟪k:1⟫non potevo⟪k:2⟫ dirglielo, ⟪k:3⟫così scrollai le spalle, fingendo esasperazione, e "
"poi mi voltai per andarmene.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Una volta mi ero offerto di riaccompagnarla al "
"bordello, ma non era mai sembrata incline all’idea di andare in giro insieme a me.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Forse "
"aveva paura degli uomini adulti, dopo quello che le era successo alla tenuta del lord, ⟪k:10⟫o "
"forse non voleva che io venissi visto in compagnia di qualcuno con un aspetto come il suo."

#: scenario8:scenario8_3BFAABCD_3881_48BB_A209_2E658D3708D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 29e2b597917159f5ab45df5ae7df97cff48a0a38b4c61f2e81e1c0b80de44a15
#. default-sha256: c6b92968204eb58ecf75715ae9b0ac159fe4997b8f7b85c8e74ca311ee0d0f2a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3BFAABCD_3881_48BB_A209_2E658D3708D1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Three years back, there was a slave revolt at the lord’s manor. ⟪k:4⟫That’s "
"not ⟪k:5⟫quite⟪k:6⟫ accurate, though, ⟪k:7⟫because, while I was partly responsible for inciting "
"the riot, I wasn’t actually a slave.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫The local lord was spoken of—in whispers"
"—as the second coming of the great tyrant of old. ⟪k:12⟫The people were constantly grumbling "
"about how he seemed to treat the land like his own personal playground, exploiting everything and "
"everyone on it for his own amusement.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫When enough stress and resentment "
"builds up in a contained space, all it takes is a little shove from the outside to burst. ⟪k:17⟫"
"And that was our plan—me and a number of other dissatisfied citizens gathered together to pop "
"that bubble and give the lord a taste of how we felt about him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Tre anni prima, ci fu una rivolta da parte degli schiavi del lord presso la "
"sua tenuta. ⟪k:4⟫Ma non è ⟪k:5⟫del tutto⟪k:6⟫ corretto, ⟪k:7⟫perché, sebbene fossi⟪k:8⟫in parte "
"responsabile per aver istigato l’insurrezione, non ero davvero uno schiavo.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫"
"Si parlava del lord del paese come della seconda venuta di un grande tiranno del passato. ⟪k:13⟫"
"Gli abitanti brontolavano continuamente per il fatto che trattava la loro terra come se fosse il "
"proprio parco giochi privato, sfruttando tutto e tutti per il proprio divertimento.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫"
"⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Quando in uno spazio ristretto si accumula troppa tensione e scontento, basta una "
"sola goccia per far traboccare tutto. ⟪k:18⟫Ed era quello⟪k:19⟫il nostro piano—⟪k:20⟫io e altri "
"cittadini insoddisfatti ci riunimmo con l’intento di far scoppiare quella bolla e di dare al lord "
"un assaggio di ciò che provavamo per lui."

#: scenario8:scenario8_8AA266C5_EB4C_4D26_823D_BBBACC2774C4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dcdf1f029ab1f3a63b24cffe36881db5bfba5098beb23c85c4f3262b78bb55d6
#. default-sha256: b70698533ac037f5a212b0dd3559ea3f75063640012703d3f6e1814414cedee3
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_8AA266C5_EB4C_4D26_823D_BBBACC2774C4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Once I was inside, I went around the manor telling all the slaves about our plan. ⟪k:1⟫Most "
"of them had long since lost the will to fight, but with enough assurance there were people on the "
"outside ready and waiting to help, glimmers of hope started to return to their eyes. ⟪k:2⟫Finding "
"out they weren’t alone, that they weren’t helpless anymore, had an incredible effect on their "
"morale.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫And once the slaves were convinced, the revolt began.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫It "
"ended up being much larger in scale than I had imagined, and many lost their lives in the "
"process, but the majority of them managed to escape. ⟪k:10⟫Naturally, the slaves couldn’t stay in "
"the city, so I directed them to people waiting outside who would take them to another city or a "
"neighboring country."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Una volta dentro ispezionai la tenuta, informando tutti gli schiavi⟪k:1⟫del nostro piano. "
"⟪k:2⟫Molti di loro avevano perso da tempo la volontà di combattere, ma assicurandogli che fuori "
"c’erano persone in attesa e desiderose di aiutare, nei loro occhi si accese un barlume di "
"speranza. ⟪k:3⟫Scoprire che non erano soli, che non erano più inermi, ebbe un effetto "
"incredibilmente positivo sul loro morale.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫E una volta convinti gli schiavi, la "
"sommossa ebbe inizio.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Questa finì per raggiungere proporzioni decisamente maggiori "
"di quanto mi ero aspettato, e in molti persero la vita lungo la strada, ma la maggior parte di "
"loro riuscì a fuggire. ⟪k:11⟫Naturalmente, gli schiavi non potevano restare in città, perciò li "
"condussi da coloro che attendevano all’esterno, i quali li avrebbero portati in un’altra città o "
"in un paese limitrofo."

#: scenario8:scenario8_B557D967_F5AF_4020_9B24_EF91766A6768
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb1e726f24496561c45bb0df6cc22ceec95fdd9e4c05e8335cedaac4becf9d0c
#. default-sha256: 02bc965f2b26875512956dd973fbfcbbd66e550f47878d28ebd5a69c4df916bf
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B557D967_F5AF_4020_9B24_EF91766A6768"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Skip forward to about a month before Morgana’s birthday.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫One day, a middle-"
"aged woman approached me. ⟪k:4⟫I had never met her before, but she had wavy hair that reminded me "
"a great deal of my own.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Looking me straight in the eye, the woman said:⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫“I was once a maidservant for the Barnier estate. ⟪k:12⟫They’ve done their best to "
"keep it secret, but I had a child with the previous lord. ⟪k:13⟫And that child... is you.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mancava un mese al dodicesimo compleanno di Morgana.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Un giorno, una "
"donna di mezza età si avvicinò a me. ⟪k:6⟫Non l’avevo mai vista prima, ma aveva dei capelli mossi "
"molto simili ai miei.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Guardandomi dritto negli occhi, la donna disse:⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫"
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫“Un tempo lavoravo come servitrice alla tenuta dei Barnier.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫Hanno fatto "
"del loro meglio per tenerlo segreto, ma all’epoca diedi alla luce un bambino, avuto insieme al "
"precedente lord. ⟪k:16⟫E quel bambino...⟪k:17⟫ sei tu.”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_EEFEEA2A_55E0_44CF_AB21_DD357EEEB931
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e02cea16e02d01c0e6eaefacec8455ddf5dcafce54c334b5d1856bd131572817
#. default-sha256: 497bc4e3c41ed622fc876e6a72f5d91122c31667f641d7e131472a535a871e97
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_EEFEEA2A_55E0_44CF_AB21_DD357EEEB931"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I obviously wasn’t going to agree on the spot. ⟪k:1⟫Her story was so blatantly dubious I "
"needed some time to think on it. ⟪k:2⟫If she ⟪k:3⟫was⟪k:4⟫ telling the truth, though, it could "
"transform our revolution from a dream into a reality. ⟪k:5⟫We wouldn’t be restricted to inciting "
"inconsequential uprisings. I could seize power legitimately and make some actual change.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫So I asked the woman to give me some time to consider."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ovviamente non avevo intenzione di accettare così su due piedi.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫La sua storia era "
"così palesemente discutibile che avevo bisogno di tempo per pensarci. ⟪k:3⟫Ma se stava dicendo la "
"verità, la nostra rivoluzione sarebbe potuta diventare realtà. ⟪k:4⟫Non saremmo stati più "
"costretti ad incitare irrilevanti sommosse. Avrei potuto prendere il potere legittimamente ed "
"apportare dei veri cambiamenti.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Perciò chiesi alla donna di darmi del tempo "
"per rifletterci."

#: scenario8:scenario8_332173AC_1F2D_4894_ADCF_342EA0D332B0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf6c69e000b606628616e8315e3e85b8a4a90b4a4d71032a3e71451ed733652c
#. default-sha256: 1a7c84bfd26c2e989a3388711286910661cd49f67d4e569cd8b06351581b95a2
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_332173AC_1F2D_4894_ADCF_342EA0D332B0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“So, is today the day? ⟪k:1⟫Are you finally gonna tell her how you feel?”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫“⟪k:5⟫Excuse me?⟪k:6⟫ ⟪k:7⟫Tell her how I ⟪k:8⟫what⟪k:9⟫?!”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫“Don’t be coy. "
"⟪k:13⟫You know exactly what, and it’s about time you manned up and told her. ⟪k:14⟫I think you’ve "
"got a better chance than you think.”⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫“Do I need to remind you how old she "
"is?”⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫“Twelve, as of today. ⟪k:21⟫Practically an adult. ⟪k:22⟫I was knee-deep in "
"dick at that age.”⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫“You’re comparing her to ⟪k:26⟫you⟪k:27⟫?”⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫"
"⟪k:30⟫“The longer you hold off saying something, the more difficult it becomes.”⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫"
"⟪k:33⟫“............”⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫“Break a leg! ⟪k:37⟫Party’s gonna be in the back, so there "
"won’t be any customers around to interfere.”⟪k:38⟫⟪k:39⟫⟪k:40⟫“...A-All right.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Allora, oggi è il grande giorno, eh? ⟪k:1⟫Finalmente le dirai cosa provi?”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫“⟪k:5⟫Scusami⟪k:6⟫? ⟪k:7⟫Dirle ⟪k:8⟫cosa⟪k:9⟫?!”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫“Non essere timido. ⟪k:13⟫"
"Sai benissimo cosa, ed è ora che tu tiri fuori le palle e glielo dica. ⟪k:14⟫Penso che tu abbia "
"più possibilità di quanto credi.”⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫“Devo ricordarti quanti anni ha?”⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫"
"⟪k:20⟫“Dodici, a partire da oggi. ⟪k:21⟫Praticamente un’adulta.⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫Io stavo già "
"succhiando cazzi alla sua età.”⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫“Stai paragonando Morgana a ⟪k:27⟫"
"te⟪k:28⟫?”⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫“Più tempo aspetti per dire qualcosa, più sarà difficile.”⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫“............”⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫“In bocca al lupo, allora! ⟪k:38⟫Festeggeremo nella stanza "
"sul retro, comunque, così non ci sarà nessun cliente a disturbarci.”⟪k:39⟫⟪k:40⟫⟪k:41⟫“...V-⟪k:42⟫"
"Va bene.”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_F2BE155B_F61C_442A_80A4_3AF832BBD871
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 95cb9814a16987bec5126075bab561191adef3e6e905bd71e88dff6d7711db59
#. default-sha256: bbf0c359de7babdb7a9a53cc9b24f87df1753288ed2705432dd5191e612d4a28
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F2BE155B_F61C_442A_80A4_3AF832BBD871"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Women seem to have this strange, somewhat terrifying ability to read people’s minds, ⟪k:1⟫"
"and Maria was a prime example of that. ⟪k:2⟫I had never once so much as suggested to anyone I "
"might think anything of Morgana, but Maria had somehow managed to pick up on it almost "
"immediately.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Fortunately, she didn’t seem particularly bothered by the fact, ⟪k:6⟫"
"though if anyone else were to find out, I could only imagine the looks I would get.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫"
"I mean, Morgana was twelve, and I was twenty-two. ⟪k:10⟫That wasn’t normal.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫"
"⟪k:14⟫(I’ve never felt this way about anyone else that young, either...)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pare che le donne abbiano questa strana e terrificante abilità di leggere nella mente delle "
"persone, ⟪k:1⟫e Maria ne era l’esempio più lampante. ⟪k:2⟫Non avevo mai accennato a nessuno "
"riguardo a ciò che pensavo di Morgana, eppure Maria era riuscita in qualche modo⟪k:3⟫a coglierlo "
"immediatamente.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Per fortuna, questo non sembrava infastidirla particolarmente; ⟪k:7⟫"
"potevo solo immaginare gli sguardi che avrei ricevuto se qualcun altro lo avesse scoperto.⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Insomma, Morgana aveva dodici anni, e io ventidue. ⟪k:11⟫Non era affatto normale.⟪k:12⟫"
"⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫(Non ho mai provato nulla del genere per una così giovane...)"

#: scenario8:scenario8_500F5DDB_332E_46A2_A289_636952A78399
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cb75d6a609a22bfd1c1984d1ac0f81a47a03fb8fbc02e04824ef2de752ae19dd
#. default-sha256: 335de21bd3cd27c6c98765993ae519b7dea9a16b95eade427632c8ca1cd2b44d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_500F5DDB_332E_46A2_A289_636952A78399"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(How would I even go about saying it, assuming I actually did?)⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫(“Even if "
"your face still isn’t healed in four years, I’ll take you as my lifetime partner, Morgana”?)⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫(God, no, that’s terrible. There has to be a better way to put it.)⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫"
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Now I was getting stressed out, and it was all thanks to Maria. ⟪k:13⟫This was "
"supposed to be a day of celebration, not of fretting over stupid personal matters."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫(Ipotizzando che io lo faccia sul serio, come dovrei dirglielo?)⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"(“Morgana, anche se il tuo viso non è guarito in questi quattro anni, ti voglio come mia compagna "
"di vita”?)⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫(Dio mio, no, è terribile. Dev’esserci un modo migliore.)⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫"
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Mi sentivo sotto pressione, ed era tutto merito di Maria.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Doveva essere un "
"giorno di festa; non era il momento di preoccuparsi per stupide questioni personali."

#: scenario8:scenario8_F7183AEE_B86F_410D_9419_6E400CC154FA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 31dea5693cd79844ba391fc1304091e9f1638f853695590377169672b6f64a85
#. default-sha256: d1d3583b1483228515abed262e4fd009031e053a22426c7beae67fdb514e0f7c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F7183AEE_B86F_410D_9419_6E400CC154FA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Not long after I arrived at the brothel and made my way to the back room, Maria "
"and a handful of other unoccupied girls showed up. ⟪k:3⟫Morgana, who was supposed to be the guest "
"of honor, was even more reticent than usual.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫The prostitutes chatted amongst "
"themselves about work in unabashedly graphic detail, trading info on which customers were good "
"and which customers were bad, ⟪k:7⟫all the while Morgana looking incredibly uncomfortable."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Arrivato al bordello, raggiunsi la stanza sul retro, e poco dopo arrivarono anche "
"Maria e un gruppo di altre ragazze libere dal lavoro. ⟪k:3⟫Morgana, che sarebbe dovuta essere "
"l’ospite d’onore, era molto più schiva del solito.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Le prostitute parlavano tra loro "
"di lavoro descrivendo ogni minimo particolare, scambiandosi informazioni su quali fossero i "
"migliori e i peggiori clienti, ⟪k:7⟫tutto questo mentre Morgana appariva incredibilmente a "
"disagio."

#: scenario8:scenario8_3F90CA22_CCC2_41AA_A4D9_3BF2BE519ECB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: af7321d1b5e17a60ce56bba899f803dd3fc3405b6391fe42438d250b1cbccf1e
#. default-sha256: 456bf5ff36dc3c93d16ad551dd4caf02ced334a581206d067496b963613bea75
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3F90CA22_CCC2_41AA_A4D9_3BF2BE519ECB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“At least eat something, then. ⟪k:1⟫The cookies are barely sweetened and dry as rocks, but "
"they’re edible.”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫“Jacopo, you little bitch! ⟪k:5⟫You’ve got some stones to shit-"
"talk my cookies to my face!”⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫“Stop it, Maria! ⟪k:9⟫Stop throwing things at "
"me!”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫The other girls cackled as Maria and I bickered. ⟪k:14⟫Hoping it "
"might have elicited a reaction from Morgana as well, I snuck a glance over at her, but she "
"remained expressionless."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Mangia qualcosa, almeno. ⟪k:1⟫I biscotti sono a malapena dolci e sono duri come la pietra, "
"ma sono commestibili.”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫“Jacopo, brutto stronzo! ⟪k:5⟫Hai davvero il coraggio di "
"parlar male dei miei biscotti di fronte a me?!”⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫“Maria, fermati! ⟪k:9⟫Smettila di "
"lanciarmi roba addosso!”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Le altre ragazze ridevano a crepapelle mentre "
"Maria ed io bisticciavamo. ⟪k:14⟫Sperando che questo avesse suscitato in Morgana una qualche "
"reazione, le diedi una rapida occhiata, ma era rimasta impassibile."

#: scenario8:scenario8_7B15FAFF_14CD_4DDC_A7B6_C0A345D38425
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bdd3e149778c6245cb2cc0ed1e8af120c1ca596c42c3a72274cddb79ea628848
#. default-sha256: bc430902a27fa7ee9bc6d101e081ab6f80d11f23588e639a6cbc41fcc9dafaf7
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7B15FAFF_14CD_4DDC_A7B6_C0A345D38425"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“You ⟪k:1⟫are⟪k:2⟫ right about one thing, though. This is Morgana’s day. ⟪k:3⟫So let’s "
"change the subject!” ⟪k:4⟫Maria said with a little laugh, having hurled everything within arm’s "
"reach at me.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫“Like I said, I don’t have anything to talk about...”⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫“Sure ya do. You just have to look a little harder. ⟪k:11⟫Not saying you have to reminisce "
"for us—it can be anything.”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫“............”⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫“Hmm, let’s see... "
"Here’s an idea: are there any guys you got your eyes on?”⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫I spewed my tea "
"all over the table.⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫“...There is.”⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫And then I "
"started choking."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Su una cosa hai ragione, però. Questo è il giorno di Morgana. ⟪k:1⟫Perciò cambiamo "
"argomento!”⟪k:2⟫—disse Maria con una risatina,⟪k:3⟫essendo rimasta a corto di roba da lanciarmi."
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“Come ho detto, non ho niente da dire...”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“Certo che c’è. Devi solo "
"fare un piccolo sforzo. ⟪k:10⟫Non devi per forza riesumare vecchi ricordi—⟪k:11⟫può riguardare "
"qualsiasi cosa.”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫“............”⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫“Mmmh, vediamo un po’... Ah, ho "
"trovato: dicci un po’, c’è qualche uomo su cui hai puntato gli occhi?”⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫"
"Sputai il tè per tutto il tavolo.⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫“...Sì.”⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫Mi stavo "
"letteralmente strozzando."

#: scenario8:scenario8_8B8CE834_8EB4_429D_AB7B_ECE664196D53
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 86fbad0a06bbeb0cd5ff8b16bb152318480745af2b79d43fcbbb1ff4b30eb306
#. default-sha256: 3173dcfe714749fc30d2da283d38855baf13e5787fb22d114695608ac482fe87
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_8B8CE834_8EB4_429D_AB7B_ECE664196D53"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“What?! ⟪k:1⟫Seriously?! ⟪k:2⟫Holy shit! ⟪k:3⟫Who is it? Tell me, who’s the lucky guy?!”⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“God.”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“............”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Everyone fell silent.⟪k:14⟫"
"⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Maria gave me a sympathetic look, and I knew exactly what she wanted to say. "
"⟪k:17⟫“Sorry kid, you ain’t got nothin’ on God.” ⟪k:18⟫Asshole."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Cosa?! ⟪k:1⟫Dici sul serio?! ⟪k:2⟫Porca miseria! Chi è il fortunato?!”⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫“Dio.”⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫“............”⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Cademmo tutti in silenzio.⟪k:13⟫"
"⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫Maria mi lanciò uno sguardo pietoso, ed io sapevo perfettamente cosa volesse dire. "
"⟪k:16⟫“Mi dispiace per te, amico. Non hai speranze contro Dio in persona.” ⟪k:17⟫Stronza."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4FA94294_D47D_4EA3_AC3F_BA217C73E67A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5e48c4e9df021779cbb7c793522eed7d96675a70e9fd475f3960c4747c83acbe
#. default-sha256: 34ef45397b4863431a0293e223431ee1c62863b9891d4078e56ccb8ed00e5a95
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4FA94294_D47D_4EA3_AC3F_BA217C73E67A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“If you’re gonna dream, dream big, right? ⟪k:1⟫Yeah, I get where you’re coming from, pining "
"after the all-powerful, all-knowing God. I’m with you!”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫“You bald-faced liar!”⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫“The grass may be a helluva lot greener up there, but it’s a bit... far, don’t you "
"think? ⟪k:8⟫You’re better off settling for the weeds down here.”⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫(Did she "
"just imply I’m a ⟪k:13⟫weed⟪k:14⟫?)⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫Maria looked over and gave a wide grin "
"at the sight of me grinding my teeth, then continued,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Se devi sognare, tanto vale sognare in grande, giusto?⟪k:1⟫ Già...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫capisco perché "
"Dio ti attira tanto, onnipotente e onnisciente com’è... Sono d’accordo con te!”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫“Schifosa bugiarda!”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“L’erba è sicuramente più verde lassù, ma è piuttosto... "
"lontano,⟪k:10⟫non credi? ⟪k:11⟫Faresti meglio ad accontentarti dell’erbaccia che c’è "
"quaggiù.”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫(Sta insinuando che sarei ⟪k:16⟫io⟪k:17⟫ l’erbaccia?)⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫"
"⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫Maria guardò verso di me, e vedendomi digrignare i denti tirò fuori un ghigno, poi "
"continuò,"

#: scenario8:scenario8_DB8C24E3_6477_4944_BA29_7A46D1968B97
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c4830e140d3f223c341843540996da552238247a5e7bed7e544d3b352b1ce271
#. default-sha256: 4edda6d91913135a4fa4b08192456c9c76261afe13c4348c222f1a8a63f8a035
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_DB8C24E3_6477_4944_BA29_7A46D1968B97"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫This⟪k:6⟫, though...⟪k:7⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Ma ⟪k:5⟫quello⟪k:6⟫...⟪k:7⟫"

#: scenario8:scenario8_F0EE88AB_81F4_4DA4_9D8A_0D472455FA40
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3530483ea7a74374552875ad55ef27423f49390bf2dbc88094055f49d439f798
#. default-sha256: af61ee83a67d8cf5c7f639af5e68fdbebd65a7843118340a7a62703694282eb1
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F0EE88AB_81F4_4DA4_9D8A_0D472455FA40"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫no, this wasn’t the kind of story I was hoping for."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...No, non era quello il genere di storia che avevo in mente."

#: scenario8:scenario8_508CD0CD_911F_4663_BBA3_F84E8FFD88CF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 270cbeded51b9ee55e1e4c3199058d59aa5819465a40233d70988e83689c0793
#. default-sha256: 9c04e16d98e58a4e671b611b128e0953de868fa526823906b85beddd1673bd5b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_508CD0CD_911F_4663_BBA3_F84E8FFD88CF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Shortly after Morgana stepped out, I heard a woman’s scream from the front of the "
"brothel. ⟪k:3⟫Next, a man shouting. ⟪k:4⟫At first, I assumed it was one of the customers losing "
"his temper over something, ⟪k:5⟫but the tone of the scream seemed somehow off for something like "
"that. ⟪k:6⟫It wasn’t long before the noise had escalated to alarming levels, so I dashed toward "
"the source of the shouting."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Poco dopo che Morgana uscì dal bagno, udii l’urlo di una donna proveniente "
"dall’entrata del bordello, ⟪k:3⟫seguito dalle grida di un uomo. ⟪k:4⟫Inizialmente, pensai che "
"fosse uno dei clienti che aveva perso le staffe per qualcosa, ⟪k:5⟫ma a giudicare dal tono degli "
"schiamazzi non sembrava essere quello il motivo. ⟪k:6⟫Non ci volle molto prima che il trambusto "
"aumentasse a livelli allarmanti, e a quel punto mi fiondai verso l’origine delle urla."

#: scenario8:scenario8_3AAE2429_D120_4398_813E_B00FDA956689
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 79a5568a1019cc6ab620cd6a967a9369a5cf08c8483a32ff7bf1ec93a6955fa8
#. default-sha256: 8a91de555b7475ec6a8b008fce3a0380fe8d7fe222eed72f77d4ffc36e493648
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3AAE2429_D120_4398_813E_B00FDA956689"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A good dozen men, bandits—or maybe thieves, they seemed more organized—had raided the "
"brothel. ⟪k:1⟫They slaughtered all the customers, stripping them of any valuables, ⟪k:2⟫and they "
"tied up the girls, killing any who resisted.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫The first thought that rose to my "
"panicked mind was that I needed to find Morgana. ⟪k:6⟫I needed to get her out of here, no matter "
"what. ⟪k:7⟫I couldn’t let her birthday turn into a tragedy.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫She had already been "
"through enough, and I had to make sure she didn’t suffer any further.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫I had to "
"make her life into something ⟪k:14⟫good⟪k:15⟫."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Un nutrito gruppo di banditi—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫o forse ladri, considerando quanto erano ben "
"organizzati—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫aveva attaccato il bordello. ⟪k:5⟫Massacrarono tutti⟪k:6⟫i clienti, "
"spogliandoli di ogni oggetto di valore, ⟪k:7⟫e legarono le ragazze, uccidendo chiunque facesse "
"resistenza.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Il primo pensiero che emerse nella mia mente terrorizzata fu quello di "
"trovare Morgana. ⟪k:11⟫Dovevo tirarla fuori da lì, a qualsiasi costo.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Non potevo "
"lasciare che il suo compleanno si trasformasse in una tragedia.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Aveva già "
"sopportato abbastanza, e dovevo assicurarmi che non soffrisse ulteriormente.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫"
"Dovevo far sì che lei avesse una vita felice."

#: scenario8:scenario8_0381B2A2_3C2A_4C29_BB9F_FDCFFE7A3CDD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2f785f5415ff92eee87c637e6b9c3d953de7798e441849f436898b4b6bc77cbd
#. default-sha256: f466f0b49ec52f2ff1c620c179a45e29a414ef38d6a2728554ad9d84b5e7a3b8
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0381B2A2_3C2A_4C29_BB9F_FDCFFE7A3CDD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I searched and I searched, but there was no sign of Morgana anywhere, ⟪k:1⟫until suddenly, "
"something seemed to crash into me from behind, causing me to stagger.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫It took a few "
"seconds for the pain to set in, which is when I looked down to see the tip of a blade sticking "
"out of my gut. ⟪k:5⟫Blood streamed along the metal surface, and there were little bits of flesh "
"caught on the edges.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫I turned around just in time to see the man holding it kick me "
"away, ⟪k:9⟫and before I had time to process what was happening, I hit the floor and lost "
"consciousness."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Cercai ovunque, ancora e ancora, ma non c’era segno di Morgana⟪k:1⟫da nessuna parte, ⟪k:2⟫e "
"tutto a un tratto, qualcosa mi colpì da dietro, facendomi barcollare.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Ci vollero "
"pochi secondi prima che il dolore sopraggiungesse,⟪k:6⟫e fu allora che abbassai lo sguardo, "
"notando la punta di una spada che sporgeva dal mio stomaco. ⟪k:7⟫Il sangue scorreva lungo la "
"superficie di metallo, e i bordi erano ricoperti da piccoli pezzi di carne.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Mi "
"voltai giusto in tempo per scorgere l’uomo che impugnava l’arma mentre mi calciava via, ⟪k:11⟫e "
"prima che potessi rendermi conto di cosa stava succedendo, crollai a terra privo di sensi."

#: scenario8:scenario8_F0FA741E_FB5E_46F6_8FE3_145A1E6157EC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 05059e718eb65c190e7b738e39ee62055aab3588bca0412835fd2ed718b67b77
#. default-sha256: d11b8a2c830da578a191cd53c94b8699ceafd84dd5f2f2cb122e7d7d30bcd711
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F0FA741E_FB5E_46F6_8FE3_145A1E6157EC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If I were a hero, I could have surely eradicated all the violent intruders in the blink of "
"an eye, saving everyone.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Protected that which I wanted to protect.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"Not had to lose anything."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se fossi stato un eroe, avrei sicuramente annientato quegli intrusi⟪k:1⟫in un batter "
"d’occhio, salvando tutti quanti.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Avrei protetto ciò che desideravo proteggere.⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Senza dover perdere nulla."

#: scenario8:scenario8_D3F788F6_EE3D_4C74_9148_9A2379F4C0EC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3d0d405ad1333a41820facdc732c4563dcf6113b4add26aa8c337e336d73fe4f
#. default-sha256: 2f640dc5e8186fc6789ee1b516bbdfb0f0268232eccfd4f38bf23ce1dd0b039f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D3F788F6_EE3D_4C74_9148_9A2379F4C0EC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫When I woke up, Maria was kneeling over me, sobbing—no sign of the tough, foul-mouthed girl "
"I knew. ⟪k:1⟫Aside from her, there were two other girls, also crying, leaving only four survivors."
"⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Apparently I wasn’t dead.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Looking down, I saw my bare stomach "
"wrapped in bloodsoaked bandages."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quando mi risvegliai, vidi Maria inginocchiata di fianco a me,⟪k:1⟫mentre singhiozzava—⟪k:2⟫"
"in lei non c’era alcuna traccia della ragazza forte e sfacciata che conoscevo. ⟪k:3⟫Oltre a lei, "
"c’erano altre due ragazze;⟪k:4⟫anche loro piangevano. Eravamo sopravvissuti solamente in quattro."
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Sembrava che non fossi morto.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Guardando in basso, vidi il mio "
"ventre fasciato con delle bende, ormai ricoperte di sangue."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E6F46659_05F6_47DF_91F1_341440939AD3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a41ca3c4ccfaf7bbddd8bfc8cf2af74b92fe53f06a3962707b79409f7537593
#. default-sha256: 5ee8ea003583c5e37024cbdebed60214c0c905b271984248cb7258bca657fa7b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E6F46659_05F6_47DF_91F1_341440939AD3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If only I had power.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Absolute, unflinching power.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫If I had "
"climbed to the top of the ladder when the chance was offered to me, ⟪k:7⟫this all could have been "
"avoided.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫If only I had asserted my place as royalty a month earlier, as the woman "
"who claimed to be my mother had urged me to..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se solo avessi avuto il potere.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Il potere assoluto, ed incrollabile.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫Se avessi colto l’occasione di scalare la vetta quando mi era stata offerta, ⟪k:7⟫tutto "
"quello si sarebbe potuto evitare.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Se solo un mese prima avessi reclamato il mio "
"posto nella nobiltà, così come la donna che aveva sostenuto di essere mia madre mi aveva esortato "
"a fare..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_B0629A92_6065_4B6F_A13E_9D528C19091B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d872bc482ed0021f23c0564528ccba16bc3c7dd6e22d0758485d46e9b3dac3fa
#. default-sha256: a813d8248aa690c75d3a5174edd07c9842653bb1c83fcd71de6d62110c8018d6
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B0629A92_6065_4B6F_A13E_9D528C19091B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I wanted power.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫The power to keep everything I cared about safe.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"The power to change this damned world.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫The power to stop those filthy thieves.⟪k:10⟫"
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫The power... ⟪k:13⟫to keep her by my side.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫I wanted power."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Volevo il potere.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Il potere di tenere al sicuro tutto ciò a cui tenevo.⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Il potere di cambiare questo dannato mondo.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Il potere di fermare quei "
"ladri schifosi.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Il potere... ⟪k:13⟫di tenerla al mio fianco.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫"
"⟪k:17⟫Volevo il potere..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_CAAFB897_BB63_43A6_BB85_A39094DF7695
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d19fa3d05d522db461aaeef744842e95f439ef630517b2943cf05e43687bfa05
#. default-sha256: b58170df7c23555374ec23305642ee412673e0a8d1ae974d2abbe6068ecdb299
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_CAAFB897_BB63_43A6_BB85_A39094DF7695"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“I heard about the attack on the brothel, ⟪k:3⟫and that you were hurt.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"I’m so glad to see you’re well.”⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫About a week after the raid, I went to see "
"the woman who professed herself my mother. ⟪k:10⟫As you would expect of someone who had served at "
"the old lord’s manor, she was very elegant and graceful. ⟪k:11⟫The shack where she stayed, "
"though, was a shabby, drab place with bare wattle and daub walls."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Ho saputo dell’assalto al bordello, ⟪k:3⟫e che sei rimasto ferito.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Sono "
"così felice che tu stia bene.”⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Circa una settimana dopo l’attacco, andai a "
"trovare la donna che aveva affermato di essere mia madre. ⟪k:10⟫Come ci si sarebbe aspettato da "
"qualcuno che aveva servito alla dimora del vecchio lord, era molto elegante e raffinata. ⟪k:11⟫"
"Tuttavia, la baracca in cui viveva era tetra e malandata, col graticcio scoperto e le pareti "
"imbrattate d’intonaco."

#: scenario8:scenario8_BBC036A7_FB43_4F69_B6C9_BD7545E7CE28
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 901b1b9b01ad8e08e7cd7d4bec8dac708e3a3c9ce31f27b5b592b44dc86a1700
#. default-sha256: a2af03afcf5817078d0020e1792a0792ead9e3d75413e29b01e8abcabd768902
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_BBC036A7_FB43_4F69_B6C9_BD7545E7CE28"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“You were concerned about my safety?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“Of course. Show me a mother who is ⟪k:4⟫"
"not⟪k:5⟫ always concerned about her child’s safety.”⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫“Says the woman I’d never seen "
"until a month ago.”⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫“Physical distance has no bearing on a mother’s love,” ⟪k:12⟫"
"she said with a soft smile.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Age had clearly begun taking its toll on her, "
"but I could see hints of former beauty."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Eri preoccupata per la mia incolumità?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“Ma certo. Quale madre non sarebbe "
"impensierita per la salute del proprio figlio?”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“Disse la donna che non avevo mai "
"visto fino a un mese fa.”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“La distanza fisica non condiziona in alcun modo l’amore "
"di una madre.”⟪k:10⟫—replicò lei con un dolce sorriso.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Il suo viso aveva "
"iniziato a mostrare chiaramente i segni dell’età,⟪k:15⟫ma riuscivo a scorgere in lei tracce di "
"una bellezza passata."

#: scenario8:scenario8_25A29562_4ECF_4556_85FD_C2DA74BBAD6D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 285088cc3c597d9458e6c5ca116cae2dc6a43f637e45f85a7bc8f2a49edee102
#. default-sha256: 778040e949e13cbcb5da74ce0e3ae917f92e748da7a58f5bb52d48eac8cb7e79
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_25A29562_4ECF_4556_85FD_C2DA74BBAD6D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Look at this. It’s the Barnier family crest. ⟪k:1⟫The previous lord gave me the ring as a "
"gift, ⟪k:2⟫and I’ve kept it ever since, even after our relationship was discovered and I was "
"chased out. ⟪k:3⟫I didn’t sell it... because I knew I was with child.”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫“............”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“They will have no choice but to acknowledge you as a "
"legitimate heir if you show them this ring.”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫“Why did you wait so long to come "
"find me, then?”⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫“I was afraid they might kill you if I brought you in as a "
"baby.”⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫“Why were we separated?”⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫“Misfortune. ⟪k:22⟫One day, "
"bandits came and kidnapped you. ⟪k:23⟫Presumably they were hired by the Barnier estate because "
"they didn’t want your existence coming to light.”⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫“............”⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫"
"⟪k:29⟫“I consider it a miracle you’re still alive.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Guarda. ⟪k:1⟫È⟪k:2⟫ lo stemma della famiglia Barnier. ⟪k:3⟫Il precedente lord⟪k:4⟫mi ha "
"dato in dono questo anello, ⟪k:5⟫e da quel momento l’ho tenuto sempre con me, anche dopo che la "
"nostra relazione venne scoperta e io fui cacciata. ⟪k:6⟫Non l’ho venduto... perché sapevo di "
"essere incinta.”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“............”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫“Se mostrerai loro questo anello, "
"non avranno altra scelta che riconoscerti come legittimo erede.”⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫“Allora perché "
"hai aspettato tanto a lungo per venire a cercarmi?”⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫“Avevo paura che ti "
"avrebbero ucciso se ti avessi portato da loro quando eri ancora in fasce.”⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫"
"⟪k:21⟫“Perché ci siamo separati?”⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫“Pura sfortuna. ⟪k:25⟫Un giorno, arrivarono "
"dei banditi e ti rapirono. ⟪k:26⟫Presumibilmente erano stati assoldati dai Barnier perché non "
"volevano che la tua esistenza venisse alla luce.”⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫“............”⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫"
"⟪k:32⟫“Il fatto che tu sia ancora vivo è per me un miracolo.”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_50A525F8_A595_46AA_9B98_A717CD92E89F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 14990b67bec8a503b08852a874044085fce0a921441d7cfef801cef10d747cc3
#. default-sha256: 59729c962e8e114f4e2aba296745e9322d5bb78e3761a4a2556b46ac1dcf55a7
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_50A525F8_A595_46AA_9B98_A717CD92E89F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I can only imagine the stern look on my face as I listened to the woman speak. ⟪k:1⟫Part of "
"me did, indeed, want to take everything she said as true. ⟪k:2⟫Wanted to believe I was someone "
"important.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫But I couldn’t convince myself I had anything other than a commoner’s "
"blood running through my veins."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Posso solo immaginare la serietà sul mio volto mentre la ascoltavo. ⟪k:1⟫Una parte di me "
"voleva credere seriamente alle parole della donna—⟪k:2⟫volevo credere di essere una persona "
"importante.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Ma non riuscivo a convincermi del fatto che quello che mi scorreva "
"nelle vene fosse sangue reale."

#: scenario8:scenario8_5486437C_79A4_4485_940A_B67428793838
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6a0c5e510e49bb8c40704654d28b5563b938a06e4aacaffd26c06d8aac16c765
#. default-sha256: f50d675123eb7fe52c447506ec5f01bd1b4f7436574a5e2be2805245225a19ac
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5486437C_79A4_4485_940A_B67428793838"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“It would appear you’ve done your research. ⟪k:1⟫I don’t have any other family, to the best "
"of my knowledge, ⟪k:2⟫which does indeed make me a good candidate for you to step in and claim "
"your stake on. ⟪k:3⟫If I were to guess, your child with the lord has either passed away or never "
"existed at all.”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“............”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“It’s probably true that you worked "
"at the Barniers’ manor, and it’s probably true that you had relations with the former lord. ⟪k:10⟫"
"You were chased out, and now you live in poverty. ⟪k:11⟫You want to go back to your former, more "
"comfortable life, and while you’re at it, take vengeance on the current lord.”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫"
"⟪k:14⟫“............”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Pare che tu abbia fatto le tue ricerche. ⟪k:1⟫Non ho nessun’altra famiglia, per quanto ne "
"so, ⟪k:2⟫il che fa di me un ottimo candidato a cui chiedere aiuto per reclamare la tua parte. "
"⟪k:3⟫Se dovessi indovinare, il bambino che hai avuto assieme al lord è morto, oppure non è "
"esistito affatto.”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“............”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“Forse è vero che hai lavorato alla "
"tenuta dei Barnier, come anche il fatto che hai avuto una relazione con il precedente lord.⟪k:10⟫"
"⟪k:11⟫Sei stata cacciata, e ora vivi in povertà. ⟪k:12⟫Vuoi tornare alla tua vecchia, comoda "
"vita, e già che ci sei, vendicarti del lord attualmente in carica.”⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫"
"⟪k:15⟫“............”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_143923A5_4479_43FC_8DDD_1F0A1CB88BF4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 778c97fdc3d4727ec954aed021fc037c8b469a75e592f9163e0039331d063a63
#. default-sha256: 3cb1dd572c3de1c0b6237ade38bbcee33386a8959db9a4861d3b6af6164f3977
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_143923A5_4479_43FC_8DDD_1F0A1CB88BF4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Haven’t you had enough danger for one life? ⟪k:1⟫C’mon, forget about all this revolution "
"stuff. ⟪k:2⟫We can build up a new brothel and just stay low for the rest of our days. Does that "
"really sound so bad? ⟪k:3⟫You’re the only friend I’ve got left, Jacopo,” ⟪k:4⟫she said, somewhat "
"desperately.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I sympathized with her concerns, but I didn’t want to let this chance to "
"gain some real power slip away.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫I was done having things taken away from me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Non hai già corso fin troppi rischi finora? ⟪k:1⟫Su, dimentica tutta questa storia della "
"rivoluzione. ⟪k:2⟫Possiamo mettere su un nuovo bordello⟪k:3⟫e starcene tranquilli per il resto "
"dei nostri giorni. Ti suona davvero tanto male? ⟪k:4⟫Sei l’unico amico che mi è rimasto, "
"Jacopo.”⟪k:5⟫—disse con un accenno di disperazione nella voce.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Comprendevo la sua "
"preoccupazione, ma non volevo lasciarmi sfuggire quell’opportunità di ottenere del vero potere."
"⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Ne avevo abbastanza di vedermi privato di ciò che avevo."

#: scenario8:scenario8_EA17329F_E75A_43BA_ADE1_26A3F11A7C3C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9d9c5ae7686f79f18baf54e5e8418f708834d5cdb5051f3fe876fceac5aca23c
#. default-sha256: af1631edf2945e600106e202047faeff030b3e93dfaf1a3f2afddf5da863a447
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_EA17329F_E75A_43BA_ADE1_26A3F11A7C3C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I am the rightful heir!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Io sono l’erede legittimo!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_7000DBC8_446A_4CB0_AEAB_C85BBA32B424
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fa768dfb26a2e07b6374303ad9dd21ca267512a1b5bbfb54b9de5601dd494b87
#. default-sha256: 446b3fc4716abd3477847b6d96096d1888eebfcd70598b1726787c8614501b53
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7000DBC8_446A_4CB0_AEAB_C85BBA32B424"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Victims of this terrible tyrant!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Vittime di un terribile tiranno!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_7127F800_978D_415A_8267_11EC7B9C8592
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7ab6840b0c6f72a9e16f1fb02c0777f5861c992fa2e4cf4433936793165cde79
#. default-sha256: dc7c162f190f3227b2f69f771e51f626f3a38e04fd48d22d83d670c86186970a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7127F800_978D_415A_8267_11EC7B9C8592"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The time has come to start anew!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫È⟪k:4⟫ giunta l’ora di ricominciare da capo!⟪k:5⟫"

#: scenario8:scenario8_40D851D5_8FD4_4474_8B95_059DFDDEDC73
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 210c1c2f3112208165208039b7a6002b88c13210e9a8c9d12e8722c644fdab1b
#. default-sha256: b9dabb7aa5c07250fd10a1330f5e6ffa1bd7321433689d0a9afcbc33e20329d3
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_40D851D5_8FD4_4474_8B95_059DFDDEDC73"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And I shall be the one to lead you down that path!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫E sarò io a guidarvi lungo la strada!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_B9D2A7DA_E011_4BB7_8DCA_8858D30581D3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5b5a8527f0185fb92c5999cb2841bacd21c8390a94f7e1399bcdbfdb67cc6ae5
#. default-sha256: b19e64ab5a3e8557daaab12090144a06d42dd74f0c4f3d433f2ac95179ea5d53
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B9D2A7DA_E011_4BB7_8DCA_8858D30581D3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The poor! The hungry! The deprived!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Il povero! L’affamato! Il disagiato!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_AE6EC68C_3EA4_47ED_9A66_E45793195EB0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5d805dd43114ebb88dc3766b0ed9d367c77f1f0991b4f56b7a1e0ec35de4ea6b
#. default-sha256: c83ec56f47bf6cc94ed019a036223fcd971893274789d2f3f3ca8093cb30a2a3
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_AE6EC68C_3EA4_47ED_9A66_E45793195EB0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The lord, backed into a corner, begged for his life.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I decapitated "
"him, then held his severed head up for the people. ⟪k:6⟫Their cheers and shouts filled the air."
"⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫As I watched them rejoice, I wondered—⟪k:10⟫was this the future that awaited me?"
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Would the people come after me next?⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Was my head going to be "
"in one of their hands one day?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Il lord, messo con le spalle al muro, implorò per la propria vita.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"Lo decapitai, e alzai al cielo la sua testa mozzata, perché tutti potessero vederla. ⟪k:6⟫L’aria "
"risuonò delle loro grida di gioia.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Mentre li vedevo esultare, mi domandai—⟪k:10⟫era "
"quello il futuro che mi attendeva?⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫La gente mi avrebbe seguito da lì in poi?"
"⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Un giorno, la mia testa sarebbe finita tra le mani di qualcuno di loro?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_18150020_3EEE_43FC_AA71_F5B2DE30BC42
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a9d57e4d9f188d60acf8da978edbcc27a981b7da146499c66b6d82aa68a88fd5
#. default-sha256: 29708b1524c6df1454340df4cab162bc4ba0db58b79328bc81e9b204cc1d5dfd
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_18150020_3EEE_43FC_AA71_F5B2DE30BC42"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I turned my attention first to bolstering the economy. ⟪k:1⟫I provided subsidies to "
"merchants in the city. I expanded trade routes. I made it known that people of any skin color, "
"even those not welcome in other territories, were welcome in my land, trying to bring some "
"vitality to the city.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The previous lord had evidently loved to throw parties, "
"squandering away nearly all the tax money on his own entertainment. ⟪k:5⟫If he had left me more "
"to work with, I would have used it to clean up and repair the slums, ⟪k:6⟫but for the time being, "
"that had to remain another item on the checklist.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫I needed more money flowing "
"through the city as a whole before I could make any headway on fixing up the poorer areas. ⟪k:10⟫"
"Helping the people who needed it most quickly became a secondary objective."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mi occupai prima di tutto di rafforzare l’economia. ⟪k:1⟫Fornii sussidio⟪k:2⟫ai mercanti "
"della città. Ampliai le rotte commerciali. E, intenzionato a ravvivare la città, decisi che le "
"persone di qualunque colore della pelle—anche quelle che non venivano normalmente accolte in "
"altri territori—sarebbero state le benvenute nella mia terra.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Il vecchio lord amava "
"organizzare feste, sperperando quasi tutti i soldi delle tasse per il proprio divertimento. ⟪k:6⟫"
"Se me ne avesse lasciati⟪k:7⟫di più, li avrei usati per ripulire e ristrutturare i bassifondi, "
"⟪k:8⟫ma per il momento avevo altre priorità, e dovetti rimandare quel proposito.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫"
"Prima di poter sistemare le aree più povere, dovevo far sì che nella città circolasse più denaro. "
"⟪k:12⟫Aiutare i più bisognosi diventò un obiettivo secondario."

#: scenario8:scenario8_FCCA8475_D1C1_4BA6_8EBA_8D0A45786A6B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: baf8f65f1ec35ff87bcbf916a2c4380c0cf60d2efe5986918ae793e48a919e3b
#. default-sha256: a09e5a10af0c7b90042d5602ffcefe0b21312e1d5a240a6935c84ca06e45aa32
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_FCCA8475_D1C1_4BA6_8EBA_8D0A45786A6B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I had a pretty good idea what my former accomplices still in the slums were saying about me. "
"⟪k:1⟫“He used us,” I could practically hear them whispering.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Some of them even "
"started publicly slandering me in an attempt to undermine my authority, ⟪k:5⟫claiming I wasn’t "
"suited to be in a position of power because I had spent most of my life in the slums. ⟪k:6⟫It "
"wasn’t long before they had convinced the people I was just another tyrant.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫I "
"had hoped that they—if no one else—would have sympathized with my position. ⟪k:11⟫Realized that I "
"had every intention of helping them, ⟪k:12⟫and that I simply didn’t have the resources for it yet."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sapevo cosa avrebbero detto sul mio conto coloro che un tempo erano stai miei complici, e "
"che vivevano ancora nei bassifondi.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Ci ha usati.”⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫—riuscivo praticamente a "
"sentirli sussurrare.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Alcuni di loro iniziarono persino a diffamarmi pubblicamente,"
"⟪k:8⟫nel tentativo di compromettere la mia autorità, ⟪k:9⟫sostenendo che non fossi adatto a "
"ricoprire un ruolo di potere perché avevo trascorso quasi tutta la mia vita nei quartieri poveri. "
"⟪k:10⟫Non ci volle molto prima che riuscirono a convincere le persone che ero soltanto un altro "
"tiranno.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Avevo sperato che almeno loro avrebbero compreso la mia "
"posizione. ⟪k:15⟫Che si sarebbero resi conto che avevo tutta l’intenzione di aiutarli, ⟪k:16⟫e "
"che semplicemente non avevo ancora le risorse per farlo."

#: scenario8:scenario8_74F4DAF7_A6A5_4130_AA52_804AC3EC79D0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 50ae0a3029a559bc9fe7418c53af9dfd9f5fb152aaa4f2b830f0f144b26e9b17
#. default-sha256: 045ba8b0fbd0b854c5232900bf2e2b52961cef84a9fff0ad5ab8609040f00711
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_74F4DAF7_A6A5_4130_AA52_804AC3EC79D0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Having absolutely no one I could trust, no one I could call an ally, hit me a lot harder "
"than I had expected. It twisted my worldview beyond recognition.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I had no need for "
"sympathy.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I couldn’t show care for anyone, otherwise someone would inevitably use "
"it against me—old friends and strangers alike.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫In fact, those who knew me best—"
"⟪k:10⟫those who were aware of where I had come from and what I had been before—⟪k:11⟫were the "
"ones who fought the hardest to tear me down."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non avere nessuno di cui potermi fidare, nessuno che potevo considerare un alleato, mi provò "
"molto più di quanto mi aspettassi. Distorse la mia visione del mondo in modo irreparabile.⟪k:1⟫"
"⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Non avevo bisogno di comprensione.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Non potevo mostrare premura per "
"nessuno, altrimenti qualcuno l’avrebbe usata contro di me—che fossero amici o sconosciuti.⟪k:7⟫"
"⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Anzi, coloro che mi conoscevano meglio—⟪k:10⟫coloro che erano consapevoli delle mie "
"origini e di ciò che ero stato un tempo—⟪k:11⟫erano quelli che lottavano più duramente pur di "
"distruggermi."

#: scenario8:scenario8_61EF1623_3BA9_4D6A_B73A_F6A05741CC9A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 358cfad3e68ec5e13842f5c7e1f4f393d99772b734914ca42dcdd987e39971bd
#. default-sha256: d2e4a3813585047141db2ecd7228eedb94eed55c79d398e6f0661bdf9d799845
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_61EF1623_3BA9_4D6A_B73A_F6A05741CC9A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Rules needed to be created.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Punishments established.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I couldn’t "
"allow anyone to take this power from me.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Anyone who so much as suggested I had come "
"from the slums—⟪k:10⟫anyone who dared disrespect me—⟪k:11⟫had to be eliminated.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫"
"All threats exterminated before they could reach me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Bisognava istituire delle norme.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Andavano stabilite delle punizioni.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫Non potevo permettere a nessuno di privarmi del mio potere.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Chiunque "
"insinuasse che venivo dai bassifondi—⟪k:10⟫chiunque osasse mancarmi di rispetto—⟪k:11⟫doveva "
"essere eliminato.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Ogni minaccia andava estirpata alla radice."

#: scenario8:scenario8_C76141A6_CD72_4910_BCFE_ACEB11E43F60
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cbbe97837879ac09ac9ecefa5e25229114a04fa3f7cbcbb65082f6452363c9d0
#. default-sha256: 515480ed4cb2ce44f9bfaaa3ad94f0cb80d569c823d0ea78060ea5da23d2c862
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_C76141A6_CD72_4910_BCFE_ACEB11E43F60"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Four years passed...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫and I found myself in a very, very distant place."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Erano passati quattro anni...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫e mi ero ritrovato in un ambiente completamente "
"diverso."

#: scenario8:scenario8_22456B4C_6629_4799_B45D_335895B81169
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 120b9e35f1e9d216f4200e8056e19b052ab50703113f34fbd78c5d7e34089be2
#. default-sha256: 872b30317a71df1a410703b4334f85e129c4678ad8541a480aac691f54dd7adb
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_22456B4C_6629_4799_B45D_335895B81169"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫One day, a curious rumor came to my attention—⟪k:1⟫the kind of whispering I wouldn’t usually "
"put much stock into.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫It was said that there was a witch living in a cottage by the "
"lake. ⟪k:5⟫Few had ever seen her face, but they claimed she had the same voice as a girl who had "
"supposedly performed miracles several years earlier in a faraway village."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Un giorno, una strana voce attirò la mia attenzione—⟪k:1⟫il genere di dicerie a cui di norma "
"non davo molto peso.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Si diceva che in una casetta vicino al lago vivesse una "
"strega. ⟪k:5⟫In pochi l’avevano vista in faccia, ma affermavano che avesse la stessa voce di una "
"ragazza che anni prima si presumeva compiesse miracoli in un villaggio remoto."

#: scenario8:scenario8_1F61E9E8_448E_41B4_A3CA_43584C803A9F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 29e2083cacb13df4caa58b384e706ee5679400b77be960d4308f5eede4a9346a
#. default-sha256: 9a339d49485c78c6446a2b39edec4a088588e7924ba447a76f88f63f72ca0306
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_1F61E9E8_448E_41B4_A3CA_43584C803A9F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I had been expecting the man to object, but he agreed almost without hesitation.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫There was a mansion on the outskirts of the city, which the previous lord had built for "
"himself and had gone unused since his death. ⟪k:5⟫It was there I decided to keep the witch, and "
"it was there I decided to establish the church. ⟪k:6⟫The nun would have ample space there to "
"provide temporary shelter to the sick and needy."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mi aspettavo che l’uomo obiettasse, invece accettò senza alcuna esitazione.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫C’era una villa ai confini della città. Il precedente lord l’aveva fatta costruire per uso "
"personale, ed era rimasta abbandonata dal giorno della sua morte. ⟪k:5⟫Decisi che era lì che "
"avrei tenuto la strega, e che lì avrei stabilito la chiesa. ⟪k:6⟫La suora avrebbe avuto "
"abbastanza spazio da offrire un rifugio momentaneo ai malati e ai bisognosi."

#: scenario8:scenario8_F670D532_1354_4437_B03F_38E1D3CF6F47
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: baa261539a05374841f8e667d8096c1422c6b5ce8895e9adba0fda4153f62a05
#. default-sha256: 42a0effbc26175321b98672fae4bb8707b185bf807f46be8485eca638257543b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F670D532_1354_4437_B03F_38E1D3CF6F47"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It’s our responsibility to offer a helping hand⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫to the sick and the poor,"
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫to pray for the abandoned souls.⟪k:7⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫È⟪k:5⟫ nostra responsabilità dare una mano⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫ai poveri e ai "
"malati,⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫e pregare per le anime abbandonate.⟪k:11⟫"

#: scenario8:scenario8_A4DB698C_F9FC_4FFE_A03A_DDCCFDA6A76E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 39d72c0e185e3bad3c7432f2bafe9bb2b63beb4b62ce36f415b8a7b2a757e04a
#. default-sha256: 15ec7b7c07070024e4e859d3bd2b997a5da870fc1505629a6f6a5983054e2a06
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A4DB698C_F9FC_4FFE_A03A_DDCCFDA6A76E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Morgana’s words from years back popped into my head.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I believed that—as "
"aggressive, self-centered, and utterly lacking in compassion as my methods may have been—⟪k:4⟫I "
"was following that mantra. ⟪k:5⟫I was offering a helping hand to people who needed it in the only "
"way I knew how.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫I wasn’t so dense as to think she would approve of me making an old "
"woman pay the price for my “charity,” though. ⟪k:9⟫Doing this made me no better than a thug.⟪k:10⟫"
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫But everything has a price. ⟪k:13⟫For every extravagant feast held, a dozen people go "
"the night without food. ⟪k:14⟫That’s simply the way of the world."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mi ritornarono in mente le parole di Morgana.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Per quanto i miei metodi fossero "
"aggressivi, egoistici e privi di qualsivoglia compassione, ⟪k:4⟫pensavo di star perseguendo quel "
"concetto. ⟪k:5⟫Stavo offrendo il mio aiuto alle persone nell’unico modo che conoscevo.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"⟪k:8⟫Certo, non ero così ottuso da pensare che lei lo avrebbe approvato. Stavo pur sempre facendo "
"pagare una donna anziana per la mia “carità”. ⟪k:9⟫Ciò non mi rendeva affatto migliore di un "
"delinquente.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Ma tutto ha un costo. ⟪k:13⟫Ogni volta che viene organizzata una "
"festa di lusso, decine di persone vanno a letto senza cena.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫È⟪k:18⟫ così "
"che va il mondo."

#: scenario8:scenario8_61554D03_893A_41EE_8BBA_179B84C6C896
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d7f11a88cacef9ab490a94b9a278cf53842ba0bcd43a8662761a615d15535fb4
#. default-sha256: 8d640fc714a84f27644b2495b3337fc0d47b5400c049ece4dca3261fd8737893
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_61554D03_893A_41EE_8BBA_179B84C6C896"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Several days later than originally planned, the swordsman finally arrived at the "
"mansion. ⟪k:3⟫I had chosen the observation tower on the grounds for the witch’s prison, and it "
"was there I waited for him.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫He showed up with a burlap sack swung over his "
"shoulder, setting it down on the ground and saying, “There’s your witch.” ⟪k:7⟫I could only hear "
"muffled grunting from inside the sack, ⟪k:8⟫but it didn’t sound like an old woman inside.⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫The man’s clothes and the bag both reeked of blood."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Diversi giorni più tardi rispetto a quanto programmato,⟪k:3⟫lo spadaccino arrivò "
"finalmente alla villa. ⟪k:4⟫Scelsi la torre d’osservazione come prigione per la strega, ed era lì "
"che lo stavo aspettando.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Si presentò con una sacca di juta che dondolava dalla sua "
"spalla.⟪k:8⟫La gettò a terra e disse, “Ecco la tua strega”. ⟪k:9⟫Potevo sentire solo dei gemiti "
"provenire dall’interno della sacca, ⟪k:10⟫ma dal suono della voce⟪k:11⟫non sembrava una donna "
"anziana.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫La sacca e gli abiti dell’uomo puzzavano entrambi di sangue."

#: scenario8:scenario8_D174ED03_34BC_4FC3_A79B_A75477B61643
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1cdb0f727ad961ab6ac58a30059f61960661330d8d7631ae9717e0fd06907d5d
#. default-sha256: 3c345c1b0a21af2d4f1968e3a128ec6cca3b4b49abe34d732bb84978e0f5f75e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D174ED03_34BC_4FC3_A79B_A75477B61643"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I felt a tinge of guilt for the woman, but it didn’t last long. ⟪k:1⟫Her role in my scheme, "
"and the fate that awaited her, was the same regardless of the condition she arrived in.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫I tossed my gaze from the man to the bag. ⟪k:5⟫He crouched down to untie it—⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫revealing⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫a young girl⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫with one "
"arm severed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Provai un leggero senso di colpa per la donna, ma non durò molto.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Il suo ruolo nel "
"mio piano, e il destino che la attendeva, erano gli stessi⟪k:3⟫a prescindere dalle condizioni in "
"cui era arrivata.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Tornai ad osservare la sacca. ⟪k:7⟫L’uomo si accovacciò per "
"aprirla—⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫rivelando⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫una giovane ragazza⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫col braccio mozzato."

#: scenario8:scenario8_EA6D90FB_E469_416A_A738_8A2F87752A30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dfc022bedf68c34dedd22270652c74c76e631242c7891ab8c97418122ac21594
#. default-sha256: 4ec1359e464fd2c11ccbd80350fcec2729fa2b59963eae50351b309a0aabccb7
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_EA6D90FB_E469_416A_A738_8A2F87752A30"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Morgana...”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Morgana...”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_04F98E44_30C7_4035_A186_6C4D936E75E8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6f16f74cd60f8806d6ae15f3e621c8e612dc8d5f662c1e367bc86ec106cf83a2
#. default-sha256: c624379e9f0576101ab3e2676277f5ad6922810421ab2c86231dbb60021f6749
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_04F98E44_30C7_4035_A186_6C4D936E75E8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My voice was hoarse and rattling.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫She looked up at me, her face just as "
"disfigured and hideous as it had been four years before.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫My mind flashed back to "
"her birthday, ⟪k:7⟫to when I had considered offering to take her as my lifetime partner if her "
"face hadn’t healed in four years’ time.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫“Is that you...?”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫"
"⟪k:15⟫Her question yanked me out of my memories."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La mia voce era rauca e tremolante.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Lei sollevò lo sguardo verso di me. Il suo "
"viso era sfigurato e raccapricciante come quattro anni prima.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Tornai con la mente "
"al suo compleanno, ⟪k:7⟫a quando avevo preso in considerazione l’idea di prenderla come mia "
"compagna di vita anche qualora il suo volto non fosse guarito in quattro anni di tempo.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫“Sei tu...?”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫La sua domanda mi trascinò via dai miei ricordi."

#: scenario8:scenario8_D4A32F3B_556D_40F8_8639_D047D18336A3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 53e6ebd1099a7fbd66001c2461e424db2964c239883ad5e4c188eb7ebddadfce
#. default-sha256: 9f7696b34bbfe14ab56830722db23d9d06b91242eccc305c41e0c9be12826081
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D4A32F3B_556D_40F8_8639_D047D18336A3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Haven’t had enough, have you? ⟪k:1⟫Leaving scars on every inch of my body wasn’t enough for "
"you?! ⟪k:2⟫You haven’t had your fill of my blood?!”⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫No... that wasn’t me..."
"⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫I—⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫I was the one who had tried to heal those wounds..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Non ne hai avuto abbastanza, eh? ⟪k:1⟫Lasciarmi cicatrici su ogni centimetro del mio corpo "
"non era abbastanza per te?! ⟪k:2⟫Non sei ancora sazio del mio sangue?!”⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫No... "
"non ero io...⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Io—⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Io ero colui che aveva cercato di guarire le sue "
"ferite..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_BC62DAA1_B501_4055_A094_5C4911619331
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2af28518f30b8890069432b06661912f74183d03e4aa5bedb0498761848172f3
#. default-sha256: 6638ee04971b7741290119a90714742947adb883eb46dbced3189a2f96445402
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_BC62DAA1_B501_4055_A094_5C4911619331"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“You’re the man who bound me... cut me up... called me a witch... and then tried to kill me! "
"⟪k:1⟫I haven’t forgotten you even for a moment!”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫No, Morgana...⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫"
"I was the man who rescued you from him..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Tu sei l’uomo che mi ha incatenata... che mi ha tagliata... che mi ha chiamata “strega”... "
"e che poi ha cercato di uccidermi! ⟪k:1⟫Non ti ho dimenticato nemmeno per un attimo!”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫No, Morgana...⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Io ero colui che ti aveva salvata da quell’uomo..."

